fonts-patrone-sans (2.0.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Now a transitional package: Patrone Sans has given way to PatroneOS's
    own fonts, which it installs (fonts-patroneos). Upgrading removes Patrone
    Sans; fontconfig sends anything that asks for it to PatroneOS Sans.

